## NEVER do these on the cPanel server
- **RESTART Node in cPanel after every frontend-only pull** — causes 503
- `touch server/tmp/restart.txt` after frontend deploys
- `npm run build` — vite is not installed on the server
- `git pull` without `GIT_SSH_COMMAND` — will fail with "Repository not found"

